WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
Take five carbon atoms
and twelve hydrogen atoms.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.650
Join them into a molecule.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.930
Now pull it apart, and join
the same atoms a different way.

4
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.590
Is that a new molecule, or the
same one drawn differently?

5
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:18.030
How many different molecules
can you build from C₅H₁₂?

6
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.130
In this mission, you'll meet
the types of structural isomer,

7
00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:25.230
and learn when a new drawing
really is a new molecule.

8
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:27.110
You'll classify alcohols,

9
00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:31.890
halogenoalkanes and amines as
primary, secondary or tertiary.

10
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:36.990
Your mission: find every molecule
you can build from C₅H₁₂.
